│                                                                              │
│ Tool-interaction skills relevant to this task:                               │
│                                                                              │
│ SKILL: fetch-before-act                                                      │
│ Trigger: The task asks you to MODIFY or DELETE a specific record, but you    │
│ must first search/look it up to obtain its id or current fields.             │
│ Procedure:                                                                   │
│   1. Search/look up the target first to obtain its id and current fields.    │
│   2. Only then call the mutating tool with the retrieved id.                 │
│ Rationale: Acting before fetching leads to fabricated ids and wrong targets. │
